  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia Regional Child Labour Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will target the worst forms of child labour in Asia, including bonded child labour. It will invest in building new evidence of how best to tackle child labour, pilot and assess different approaches and support policy dialogue with governments and regional bodies. As a regional programme, it will also engage closely with DFID country offices to help them scale up work on child labour in their programmes in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
